out of sight.<br><br>\ud83d\udee1\ufe0f Protect your phone from being stolen by thieves <br>Imagine you\u2019re abroad, where street pickpocketing is a concern. With this anti-thief dont touch phone app, you don&#39;t have to worry anymore. Its motion alert system shields your phone from theft, sounding an alert if anyone tries to steal with it.<br><br>\ud83c\udf97\ufe0f How do you use it?<br>Dont Touch: AntiTheft My Phone is simple to use. Just download it, grant the necessary permissions, and follow these steps:<br>1 - Choose a sound you want for the alarm.<br>2 - Set the duration and adjust the volume.<br>3 - Select your flash and vibration preferences.<br>4 - Save your settings, return to the home screen, and tap to activate or deactivate the alert.<br><br>Utilizing this application offers a convenient method for safeguarding your phone against theft and intrusion. With the app&#39;s assistance, you can ensure that you never misplace your device. Experience enhanced phone security by giving Dont Touch: Antitheft My Phone a try today!",
